      Entry: 1
      Data: Hey, I'm helper sign! The wooden sign to your right.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: Left click somewhere to move. Right click to interact with things. Use
        the scrollwheel to switch inventories.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: Let's start simple. Take the paper to the recycling bin.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: Once you do so a timer will start. Clean up the classroom before it runs
        out!
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: I'll give you feedback whenever you chuck something in the bin so check
        in with me!
